te; verify French 3, Basic count 7. This restores data to precondition. Good.\n2. Then add notes of other types for count matrix testing, and delete them later via browser.\n\nActually the \"changed\" area is Manage note types counts; using undo tests consistency. Let me do undo reversal first.\n\nBack to deck list."}
