ow stale values from a previous computation (cache) and don't refresh after changes. We tested adding a note then re-entering: updated. Hmm.\n\nWhat if you add a note *while Manage note types is in the back stack*? You can't (it's modal from deck list; can't add note while it's in back stack). Unless via undo? no.\n\nWhat about renaming/deleting a note type and counts? Let's test the row \"more_actions\" menu: Rename, Delete, etc. If delete a note type with notes, count of others should update? Deletion moves notes? Let's see the menu first. Tap Basic's more_actions (5)."}
